# Image Background Remover

An interactive Streamlit application that removes image backgrounds using deep-learning-based segmentation (`rembg`).

## Features

- **Automated Removal:** Detects subjects and removes backgrounds in seconds.
- **Multiple Formats:** Supports PNG, JPG, JPEG, and WebP inputs.
- **Export:** Downloads high-quality transparent PNG files.

